# BAGIAN E — FIRESTORE CLEANUP & CLOUD DATA RESET

Lakukan pemeriksaan khusus terhadap Cloud Firestore.

Identifikasi:
1. Root collections khusus stok.
2. Nested collections khusus stok.
3. Subcollections.
4. Stock documents.
